  "limitations": [
    "No affected customer machine, installed binary, real Ollama 0.5.7, or real model evaluation was available. qwen2.5:7b is a separate model-ID control, not an emulation of the older runtime.",
    "Roster/model save and readback were exercised through real HTTP routes; browser focus changes and the Michael Scott UI session were not reproduced.",
    "The baseline model-catalog probe used an incorrect route and returned 404; it provides no discovery proof. Final source uses the supported route, returns all three model IDs, and disables named auxiliary fixture jobs.",
    "Baseline SKYNET_AUX_BUDGET=0 means unlimited, not disabled. It was removed from the final probe; all matching run requests and controlled endpoint releases are retained.",
    "The historical 605-second observation does not prove the timeout phase. Ollama connect failures still use the existing ordinary ladder; this repair changes no pre-header deadline.",
    "Full fast/HTTP/journey and installed-app acceptance gates belong to integration coordination and were not run here."
  ],
